キィニチ","textMapHash":1339849506,"text":"どうやら全部処理できたようだな。アビスの勢いも弱まってる。","nextNodeIds":[50130813]},{"nodeId":50130813,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3350479194,"text":"数の勝負なら、反魂の詩が負けるはずないもんな！数に頼ってる時点で、あいつらの負けだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[50130814]},{"nodeId":50130814,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":94413858,"text":"…待った。アビスが魔物を集めて、競技場に向かわせてるようだ。","nextNodeIds":[50130815]},{"nodeId":50130815,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1710100266,"text":"反魂の詩が一番の障害だと気づいたか。聖火を破壊する気だな。","nextNodeIds":[50130816]},{"nodeId":50130816,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1087,"speakerName":"ムアラニ","textMapHash":2131093026,"text":"そんなことさせないよ！みんな、競技場に向かおう！","nextNodeIds":[50130817]},{"nodeId":50130817,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":1357385546,"text":"新しいアビスの忌瘤が落とされたみたいだね。どれも競技場の近くっぽいから、手分けして破壊しよう。","nextNodeIds":[50130818]},{"nodeId":50130818,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":4095826450,"text":"そうだ、競技場の入口を守る人も必要だよね。","nextNodeIds":[50130819]},{"nodeId":50130819,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1069841210,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[50130820]},{"nodeId":50130820,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1087,"speakerName":"ムアラニ","textMapHash":569840994,"text":"よ～し、これが最後の戦いだよ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[501308,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["20238017","4"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_ABYSS_WAR_LIMIT_REGION_STATE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["24","4"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_ABYSS_WAR_LEVEL_STATE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":[],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_FINISH_ABYSS_WAR_ACCOUNT_PERFORMANCE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["20238001","4"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_ABYSS_WAR_LIMIT_REGION_STATE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":